**Jefferson Capital** 's reporting of this debt, which was done without my permission, has defamed my character, undermining my **credit worthiness**, **reputation**, and **personal integrity**. This **misleading information** is damaging not only my ability to obtain future credit but also tarnishing my reputation in the community.

I request : - Immediate **deletion** of all negative, misleading, or inaccurate information from my credit reports across all three major credit bureaus ( XXXX XXXX XXXX and XXXX ), - Written confirmation that **all erroneous information** has been removed. 

For these violations, I am demanding XXXX XXXX XXXX each for the following : - **Defamation of character**, - **Damaged reputation**. 

-- - # # # **3. Damage to Credit Worthiness and Mode of Living** The false reporting of this debt has seriously damaged my **credit score** and **creditworthiness**, impacting my financial opportunities, including access to loans, housing, and employment. Additionally, this situation has affected my **mode of living**, causing stress and hardship.

I request the following : - **Immediate deletion** of the erroneous information from my credit reports, - Written confirmation that **all incorrect information** has been deleted, and **corrected reports** are issued.

For these violations, I am demanding XXXX XXXX for the damage to my **credit worthiness** and XXXX XXXX XXXX for the damage to my **mode of living**. 

-- - # # # **4. Infringement on Right to Privacy** The unauthorized access and use of my personal data is an infringement on my **right to privacy** under both the **Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) ** and the **Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act ( GLBA ) **. **Jefferson Capital** has reported information about me without my consent and has violated my personal privacy.

I request : - Detailed documentation about how my personal information was accessed and shared by **Jefferson Capital** , - Proof that **Jefferson Capital** followed all **privacy protections** under the law.

For this violation, I am demanding XXXX XXXX XXXX in compensation for the infringement on my **right to privacy**. 

