The second repossession occurred without proper notice or compliance with Uniform Commercial Code ( UCC ) Article 9 provisions governing secured transactions. 
The vehicle was sold without notifying me, further violating state repossession laws. 
Inaccurate Credit Reporting Veros Auto Loan falsely reported the account on my credit report with a "" Charge-Off '' status and ongoing delinquencies, despite disputes and evidence of fraud.

